2026-09-08T10:13:29.5650425Z [36;1m# If we detect an incompatible value, set it to "git" which is always supported.[0m
2026-09-08T10:13:29.5651172Z [36;1mif [[ "rustc 1.98.1 (48a229cea 2026-09-01)" =~ ^rustc\ (1\.6[67]\.|1\.68\.0-nightly) && "${CARGO_REGISTRIES_CRATES_IO_PROTOCOL}" == "sparse" ]]; then[0m
